<title>UK: Copper drifts after small LME inventory rise.</title>
<headline>Copper drifts after small LME inventory rise.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Dips slightly after a small stocks rise. Seen heading below $2,500 a tonne. Resistance pegged st $2,525.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Stable, stocks down again.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Quiet.</p>
</text>
